stem, assigned owners and agreed retest criteria with business data stewards; the next mock load cleared those recorded exceptions.\nEducation\nBachelor of Business Administration | Example College | 2014\nSkills\nSAP S/4HANA; SAP MDG; UAT; defect triage; master-data reconciliation",
